---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Family Holiday Thailand – how to visit Khao Sok with children"
  description="Visit Khao Sok with children for the perfect family holiday in Thailand, Explore Khaosok nature, book a family room & a Khao Sok family tour."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/riverside-6.jpg"
  heroTitle="Family Holiday Thailand – how to visit Khao Sok with children"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Family Holiday Thai...", "href": "/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          One of our favorite things about Khao Sok is It is a great choice for a family holiday in Thailand. At Riverside Cottages, we can help you plan a great Khao Sok family tour. You can also book a family room at our resort.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Learn how visiting Khao Sok with children is not only possible, but a great idea. Need a family friendly Khao Sok tour? Read on to learn more.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Visiting Khao Sok with children – where to stay – Choose a Khao Sok family room</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          When on a family holiday in Thailand with kids, the first concern is safety, followed by a good sleep. At Riverside Cottages, we have large, secure and comfortable family bungalows.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For families travelling with kids, we have family rooms. These rooms can easily sleep four people. We can also add a mattress for another person! Our Riverside family rooms are especially popular for travelers touring Khao Sok with small children.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Families visiting Khao Sok with kids that are old enough to have a room to themselves will love our adjoining rooms. A wall separates these rooms, which feature private bathrooms but share a balcony and front porch. This makes them perfect for families with older children and teenagers, where getting some privacy is a top priority! You can find more information about our Khao Sok family room choices on our <a href="/booking-khao-sok-accommodation/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">booking page</a>!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/riverside-6.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Family room"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Family room</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/River_Exterior_Family_G0020349.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Family room"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Family room</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Dining as a family in Khaosok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Eating out on a family holiday in Thailand can be tough for kids. Even adults may struggle with the spiciness of Thai food! With this in mind, we have adapted the menu of our Riverside Restaurant to suit the needs of our guests. Our ‘Pasta Nederland’ (Spaghetti with butter and cheese) is a huge hit with the kids, as are our banana pancakes!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As parents, we also take great care to pick out the best quality juices we can. We don’t want our kids loading up on sugar and preservatives, and we feel the same about the children of our guests. This way, everyone on a Khao Sok family tour can enjoy a meal in comfort, no matter how small.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Restaurant.jpg"
            alt="khao sok with children - Family friendly restaurant"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">khao sok with children - Family friendly restaurant</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Traveling to Khao Sok with children isn’t all about the kids, though. Parents need to enjoy their holidays too! Therefore, we make sure to keep the pantry stocked with fresh coffee, beer, and ingredients for other adult beverages.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We have a games library and a chill-out zone. Kids can have fun and hang out there. Meanwhile, parents can enjoy a relaxing evening just a few feet away.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Planning a family holiday in Khao Sok Thailand?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This can be more challenging than it sounds! When you book a family room with us, we will use our knowledge as locals and parents. We will make the activities safe for kids, interesting for parents, and fun for everyone. Keep reading for our favorite suggestions for families with children.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Jungle2.jpg"
            alt="khao sok family tour"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">khao sok family tour</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Cooking1.jpg"
            alt="Khaosok cooking with kids on a family holiday in Thailand"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khaosok cooking with kids on a family holiday in Thailand</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Cooking2.jpg"
            alt="Kids cooking thai food on a family holiday in Thailand"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Kids cooking thai food on a family holiday in Thailand</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>River Activities</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          A <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">guided canoe trip</a> is possible year-round and takes your family through the amazing Khao Sok jungle. Our guides are wonderful <a href="https://animaladvocatesinternational.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/The-Value-of-Wildlife-Blog.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">wildlife</a> spotters, and will show you all the animals in the trees above.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">River tubing</a> is another great activity for families visiting Khao Sok with children. A guide will take you on the river. They will help you avoid obstacles and enjoy all the cool nature along the way. This is a more adventurous way to see the river, and great for kids that are decent swimmers.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Canoe.jpg"
            alt="Khaosok canoe trip"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khaosok canoe trip</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Cultural Activities</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Elephant Retirement</a> and <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-cooking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Jungle Cooking</a> activities are incredibly popular with families. These should be a top consideration for anyone’s family-friendly Khao Sok tour. You get to meet the locals on both these activities and they involve some hands-on learning opportunities. As a bonus, you get to wash an elephant or enjoy a wonderful dinner, depending on the activity.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our advice is to do both! You can combine these activities for a full-day of fantastic family-friendly fun!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/khao-sok-elephant-bathing.jpg"
            alt="Elephant refuge"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Elephant refuge</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Lake Trip</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">lake trip</a> is a popular activity in Khao Sok. However, we advise caution for those on a Khao Sok family tour.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The <a href="/cheow-lan-lake-information-guide/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan lake</a> is intensely rugged and isolated, and conditions at the <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">floating bungalows</a> reflect this. As a result, an overnight trip with children might prove more difficult than fun.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The hikes at the lake are hard and can be dangerous for those who lack strength or skill. For this reason, we recommend that children under the age of 10 not participate in these hikes.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Plenty remains to do at the lake, however, and parents shouldn’t feel discouraged from making this trip with their children! We simply advise you to be aware of conditions at the lake. Any guests with questions or concerns are welcome to contact us, or speak with reception after arrival!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Lake1.jpg"
            alt="Khaosok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khaosok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Lake2.jpg"
            alt="Family Holiday Thailand - Khaosok Lake adventure"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Family Holiday Thailand - Khaosok Lake adventure</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Whether booking your Khao Sok family room, or planning your Khao Sok family tour, we’ve got you covered! Our bungalows will keep you safe and comfortable.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The Riverside Cottages restaurant will keep your family happy and well-fed. Our <a href="/khao-sok-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khaosok activities</a> will provide lasting memories that your family will treasure for years to come! We look forward to seeing you in Khao Sok on your Thailand family holiday!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For a deeper dive visit our <a href="/khao-sok-blog/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Blog</a> and <a href="/khao-sok-faqs/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">FAQ</a> pages
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
